{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n銅鑼灣午市平價飯!最平$29起\n</p>\n<h2>人氣潮汕牛肉火鍋推$29起午市套餐</h2>\n<p>銅鑼灣新開人氣王府潮汕牛肉火鍋由即日起至 2026 年 11 月 30 日，凡惠顧堂食全新午市套餐，即可享「二人同行.半價試食」優惠，折後價錢低至$29 起！嚴選每日新鮮直送的潮汕牛肉及優質食材，精心設計出8款午市套餐，重點推介包括口感軟嫩彈牙的$39「新鮮潮汕崩沙腩飯」、鑊氣十足的$34「生炒牛肉飯」，以及滋味濃郁的$29「沙爹鮮牛煎蛋飯」等，性價比好高！</p>\n<p>王府潮汕牛肉火鍋<br/>\n地址：銅鑼灣登龍街18號VPOINT5樓<br/>\n電話：<a>2633 3586</a><br/>\n午市供應時間：星期一至日 11:30–16:30<br>\n官方IG：@wangfu_hk</br></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515442836093294_17790746966affe1fcc5f85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515442836093294_17790746966affe1fcc5f85.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443052242110_5813867956affe1ff237a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443052242110_5813867956affe1ff237a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443244184814_173969806affe200ce9cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443244184814_173969806affe200ce9cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443433491052_5483433046affe202a6b5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443433491052_5483433046affe202a6b5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443632221581_3865334966affe204d430a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443632221581_3865334966affe204d430a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443841377158_17163792306affe206bf0b8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515443841377158_17163792306affe206bf0b8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df8sYSeE7XC/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.953836+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":430,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:31.443195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:34.747209+00:00","content_hash":"b5ddac206d31393087988b3b3f9c518ed1fd11fd3fdebd96687ea4186b68f351","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}